{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/architecture/mutation-reactions","title":"Mutations must have a read-side reaction","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"mutations-must-have-a-read-side-reaction","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Mutations must have a read-side reaction"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"assertMutationHasReactOn"},{"t":"text","text":" requires every mutation to have an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"insertReactOnMutation"},{"t":"text","text":" edge to a query, unless the mutation is explicitly"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"allowed:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"function","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"keepReadsFreshAfterWrites","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"graph"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"ArchitectureGraph","kind":"type"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"assertMutationHasReactOn","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph.graph, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    allow: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'logout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-it-prevents","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What it prevents"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The stale-list bug is easy to write:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createTask"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"mutation","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'createTask'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"method","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"input"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"NewTask","kind":"type"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" input,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  loader: saveTask,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// The list query exists, but nothing says it reacts to createTask.","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The write succeeds and the database contains the new task, while the list on"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"screen remains unchanged until a full reload. The graph sees that the mutation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"has no "},{"t":"code","text":"triggers"},{"t":"text","text":" edge and fails CI."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-declared-relationship","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The declared relationship"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Put the insertion on the query:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'tasks'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { params: filters, loader: loadTasks },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"insertReactOnMutation","kind":"function"},{"text":"(createTask, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    reload: { onMutationSuccess: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same rule covers nested "},{"t":"code","text":"insertQueryPipe"},{"t":"text","text":" composition. It does not require"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"every mutation to reload every query — only that the write has an explicit"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"read-side policy somewhere."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"legitimate-fire-and-forget-writes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Legitimate fire-and-forget writes"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Logout, telemetry and an export may intentionally have no query to refresh:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"assertMutationHasReactOn","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph.graph, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  allow: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'logout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'sendTelemetry'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'exportUsers'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep the allowlist named and small so a newly orphaned mutation cannot hide in a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"generic "},{"t":"code","text":"allow: ['*']"},{"t":"text","text":" convention."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"waive-one-mutation-in-architecture-waivers-ts","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Waive one mutation in "},{"t":"code","text":"architecture/waivers.ts"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-architecture-check"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"architectureReport"},{"t":"text","text":" do not take the "},{"t":"code","text":"allow"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"list: they read "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture#waivers","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"architecture/waivers.ts"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation-react-on"},{"t":"text","text":" rule reports "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one finding per mutation"}]},{"t":"text","text":", and each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"finding names the waiver target of that mutation, "},{"t":"code","text":"primitive:<owner>.<name>"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"Mutation logout has no query reacting to it (src/session.ts:5). Add"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"insertReactOnMutation(logout, …) to the query this write makes stale. For a"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"fire-and-forget write (logout, telemetry, export), waive this mutation alone in"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"architecture/waivers.ts: { rule: 'mutation-react-on', target: 'primitive:Session.logout', reason }."}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Before — a "},{"t":"code","text":"'*'"},{"t":"text","text":" waiver excuses every mutation of the application, including"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the next one that forgets its "},{"t":"code","text":"insertReactOnMutation"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// ❌ hides every future orphaned mutation","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"rule"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'mutation-react-on'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"target"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'*'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"reason"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'A logout has no read side to refresh.'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"},","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"After — the waiver names the one legitimate fire-and-forget mutation; any other"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"mutation without a reaction still fails the check:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// ✅ excuses Session.logout only","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"rule"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'mutation-react-on'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"target"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'primitive:Session.logout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"reason"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'A logout has no read side to refresh.'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"},","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The fix is a choice, not an autofix: either add "},{"t":"code","text":"insertReactOnMutation(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the query the write makes stale, or, when nothing on screen reads what the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"mutation writes, copy the target from the message into a reasoned waiver. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"targeted waiver becomes "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"stale"}]},{"t":"text","text":", and fails the check, once its mutation gains"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a reaction or is removed."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A "},{"t":"code","text":"'*'"},{"t":"text","text":" waiver for "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation-react-on"},{"t":"text","text":" is still accepted, so existing waiver"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"files keep passing, but prefer one targeted waiver per fire-and-forget mutation."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/react-on-mutation","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reacting to mutations"}]}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/06-mutate-data","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Write server data"}]}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"what-it-prevents","text":"What it prevents"},{"level":2,"id":"the-declared-relationship","text":"The declared relationship"},{"level":2,"id":"legitimate-fire-and-forget-writes","text":"Legitimate fire-and-forget writes"},{"level":3,"id":"waive-one-mutation-in-architecture-waivers-ts","text":"Waive one mutation in architecture/waivers.ts"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See also"}]}